// Temporary workaround for a gopsutil panic on macOS 27 / Apple M6 hardware:
// cpu.getFrequency() dereferences a missing voltage-states5-sram property and
// segfaults in CFDataGetLength(NULL). This is the patched fork referenced by
// shirou/gopsutil#2163; drop the replace once upstream ships the fix.
replace github.com/shirou/gopsutil/v4 => github.com/hsdfat/gopsutil/v4 v4.26.9-0.20260925154932-b689427e410d
